## 4. Protocol Chain

```
Peppol Corner 1–4
EN 16931 invoice → AS4 transport → Corner 5
        │
        ▼
Layer 3 — Transformation
JCS canonicalisation → DD-18 scrubbing → two artifacts:
  [A] Full encrypted JSON (audit record)
  [B] Public DTEP JSON (M0–M5)
        │
        ▼
Layer 4 — Taler Exchange signing
M0 = coin commitment (replaces SHA512)
Ed25519 signature over [B]
        │
        ├─────────────────────────┐
        ▼                         ▼
Layer 5 — DRRDB            Taler Wallet Interface
Public level               B2B payment reference
→ Central VIES             bound to M0
Protected level
→ EUDI Wallet / Audit
        │
        ▼
Layer 6 — Analytical Layer
R(c,t) → δ(e) → L(t) → τ(H)
Fraud signal → Audit Request
```

