## 5. Protocol Stack

| Layer | Input | Process | Output |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1. Regulatory Context | eIDAS 2.0 / ISO 6523 | Subject identification via EUDI Wallet | W3C Verifiable Credentials |
| 2. Peppol Transport | EN 16931 XML | B2B delivery and Corner 5 reporting via AS4 | XML stream to DTEP-F middleware |
| 3. Transformation | XML from Layer 2 | JCS canonicalisation & DD-18 scrubbing | Full encrypted JSON / Public DTEP JSON |
| 4. Signing | Public DTEP JSON | Taler Exchange Ed25519 signing | Signed evidence object |
| 5. DRRDB | Signed DTEP JSON | Layered storage and API differentiation | Real-time feed to Central VIES |
| 6. Analytical Layer | Public sets M1–M5 | Four primitives computation | Fraud signal / Audit Request |

